{# ▶ Slideshow ▾ (0660), in the bar of every page of tiles served by the home server
   (`tv_here`): the same small panel as 📚 Album ▾ (`.barPanel`). 🖥 *On this PC* starts the
   show and opens its full-screen tab (0659); 📺 *On the TV*, greyed with its *how* line
   while no TV is paired (`GET /api/tv-paired`, asked at each opening). The files picked,
   or nothing picked: every file of the page, their count in each entry. The target used
   last comes first (per viewer, localStorage). Hidden off the PC: a paired phone keeps its
   own *Show on the TV* buttons. Its script: pick_slideshow.js.j2. #}
<details id="showBar" class="barPanel closesOnChoice" hidden
         data-paired="{{ tv_paired_path | default('') }}"
         data-one="{{ ngettext('{n} photo', '{n} photos', 1) }}" data-many="{{ ngettext('{n} photo', '{n} photos', 2) }}">
  <summary id="showOpen" class="plain" title="{{ _('Show the files picked as a slideshow, on this PC or on the TV; nothing picked: every file of the page') }}" aria-label="{{ _('Slideshow') }}">▶ <span class="showWord">{{ _("Slideshow") }}</span> ▾</summary>
  <div class="panelBody">
  <span class="panelRow" id="showTargets">
    <button id="showHere" class="plain" type="button" data-target="here" data-path="{{ albums_path }}"
            data-sent="{{ _('The show starts in the new tab: click the photo there for full screen.') }}"
            data-sending="{{ _('Starting the show on this PC…') }}">🖥 {{ _("On this PC") }} · <span class="showCount"></span></button>
    <button id="showTv" class="plain" type="button" data-target="tv" data-path="{{ albums_path }}"
            data-sent="{{ _('Sent to the TV: its remote opens.') }}"
            data-sending="{{ _('Starting the show on the TV…') }}">📺 {{ _("On the TV") }} · <span class="showCount"></span></button>
  </span>
  <p id="showHow" hidden>{{ _("No TV paired:") }} {% if header is defined and header.slideshow %}<a href="{{ header.slideshow }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ _("how") }}</a>{% else %}{{ _("see the slideshow chapter.") }}{% endif %}</p>
  </div>
</details>
